  "content": [
    {
      "text": "God hath made. Youngest son of Zeruiah, one of David’s 30 heroes (2 Sam. 23:24) and a commander in his army (1 Chr. 27:7); celebrated for his swiftness of foot, an accomplishment much valued in ancient times; slain by Abner (2 Sam. 2:18–32); Joab’s revenge (3:27–30; see also 1 Chr. 2:16; 11:26). Three other persons, 2 Chr. 17:8; 31:13; Ezra 10:15.",
